WEBVTT

NOTE Automatically aligned; listening review pending.

line-1
00:00:08.400 --> 00:00:10.400
I'm Chmittens, black-tie silhouette

line-2
00:00:11.060 --> 00:00:12.820
Three o'clock meeting hasn't happened yet

line-3
00:00:13.280 --> 00:00:15.140
I watch very violently, perfectly still

line-4
00:00:15.640 --> 00:00:17.280
Somebody has to run this windowsill

line-5
00:00:17.800 --> 00:00:19.500
Chmeeze brings one thought to the floor

line-6
00:00:19.680 --> 00:00:21.800
I keep an eye on him and one on the door

line-7
00:00:22.140 --> 00:00:24.020
You need the keys? I've got the board

line-8
00:00:24.320 --> 00:00:26.240
You need the table? I'm already yours

line-9
00:00:26.520 --> 00:00:28.240
You stand to leave, I take your knee

line-10
00:00:28.360 --> 00:00:29.800
That's not chance. That's strategy

line-11
00:00:30.120 --> 00:00:31.680
I'm Mr. Inconvenient

line-12
00:00:32.480 --> 00:00:34.720
Black tie, no invitation

line-13
00:00:35.960 --> 00:00:37.980
Right where you're trying to be

line-14
00:00:38.760 --> 00:00:40.580
I'm Mr. Inconvenient

line-15
00:00:41.260 --> 00:00:43.640
Boss of the whole operation

line-16
00:00:44.300 --> 00:00:47.020
But keep a little room for me

line-17
00:00:48.960 --> 00:00:51.140
Door cracks open, my operation goes live

line-18
00:00:51.340 --> 00:00:53.040
Tuxedo flying past a hand on either side

line-19
00:00:53.420 --> 00:00:55.420
Left at the corner, double back, disappear

line-20
00:00:55.760 --> 00:00:57.380
I won't surrender my hallway frontier

line-21
00:00:57.720 --> 00:00:59.620
My strong meow could command a fleet

line-22
00:01:00.100 --> 00:01:01.880
Then I start whining when the pets aren't complete

line-23
00:01:02.160 --> 00:01:03.960
I climb in your lap; I've dropped the disguise

line-24
00:01:04.300 --> 00:01:06.400
I'm black tie outside, baby inside

line-26
